+# Makefile for gperf/tests
+
+# Copyright (C) 1989, 1992, 1993, 1995, 1998, 2000, 2002, 2003 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+# Written by Douglas C. Schmidt <schmidt@ics.uci.edu>
