+# Makefile for gperf/doc
+
+# Copyright (C) 1998, 2000, 2002-2003 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+# Written by Douglas C. Schmidt <schmidt@ics.uci.edu>
+# and Bruno Haible <bruno@clisp.org>.
